WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:56.080 --> 01:57.340
Scatter...

02:01.680 --> 02:03.150
Sand...

02:10.460 --> 02:11.290
I...

02:15.200 --> 02:16.490
Ko?! Are you here?!

02:18.100 --> 02:18.930
Yes...

02:19.700 --> 02:22.500
Call Tatsuhiko here. Right now.

02:24.070 --> 02:28.980
Our Fox Deity, Unsealed

02:48.930 --> 02:51.960
As usual, this place is in the middle of nowhere!

02:52.630 --> 02:54.800
The air's so fresh!

03:02.510 --> 03:04.410
Hey!

03:07.180 --> 03:09.780
Hi, Uncle Tatsuhiko!

03:09.780 --> 03:12.320
It's been a while! How've you been?

03:12.320 --> 03:13.290
Great.

03:14.460 --> 03:15.080
How's your father?

03:15.390 --> 03:16.460
He's fine, too.

03:16.460 --> 03:18.830
He apologized for being unable to make it today.

03:18.830 --> 03:21.620
He shouldn't. I'm the one who
suddenly called you out here.

03:22.130 --> 03:24.860
Is old lady Mizuchi that sick?

03:27.640 --> 03:28.970
Grandma?!

03:29.140 --> 03:30.540
Long time no see, indeed.

03:30.540 --> 03:34.310
B-But on the phone, Uncle said you were dying...

03:34.310 --> 03:38.370
About that. It was just an
excuse to lure you guys here.

03:39.410 --> 03:41.380
Lure?

03:42.120 --> 03:43.380
For what?

03:43.890 --> 03:47.290
It seems there are yokai who seek your lives.

03:47.890 --> 03:48.750
Well, Toru's.

03:49.490 --> 03:51.080
Y-Yokai?!

03:53.030 --> 03:54.400
U-Um...

03:54.400 --> 03:55.950
Don't worry about a thing.

03:56.660 --> 04:00.690
I swear on the name of the Water Priestess,
the Mizuchi family will protect you.

04:00.840 --> 04:02.570
What do you mean?

04:02.570 --> 04:07.600
Miyako really didn't tell you guys anything.

04:11.910 --> 04:16.750
The Mizuchi family comes from a long line of
shamans of the water affinity in the Five Phases.

04:17.990 --> 04:21.850
Your mother was the last
priestess of the Mizuchi family.

04:22.890 --> 04:26.620
There has always been a female family
member there to take the role as priestess.

04:26.690 --> 04:29.790
We think it's because of some
mysterious power at work.

04:30.470 --> 04:34.470
But as each generation passed,
our powers weakened.

04:34.470 --> 04:40.310
Because of this, the yokai we managed to ward
off in the past have begun attacking again.

04:40.880 --> 04:44.540
Among the yokai, there are those who
feed off the water affinities of the Mizuchi.

04:44.750 --> 04:47.610
Am I going to get eaten by these yokai?

04:47.880 --> 04:50.820
I said we'll protect you, didn't I?!

04:50.820 --> 04:55.090
But you just said the powers
of the Mizuchi are weakening!

04:55.090 --> 04:57.390
It's okay! It'll be fine.

05:02.100 --> 05:03.560
Welcome home.

05:05.030 --> 05:07.700
I suppose you haven't met before.

05:08.340 --> 05:11.870
Her name is Ko.
She is a Mamorime of the Mizuchi.

05:11.870 --> 05:13.240
A Mamorime?

05:14.080 --> 05:15.340
Excuse me.

05:18.850 --> 05:20.010
What is this?!

05:20.010 --> 05:21.570
It's salt meant to purify you.

05:24.950 --> 05:26.940
Did you have to purify them now?

05:27.690 --> 05:35.150
The Journey Deity of the east sent a messenger.
An outsider has crossed the border.

05:35.430 --> 05:37.690
It must have followed Toru here.

05:39.930 --> 05:40.830
Toru.

05:41.700 --> 05:44.260
I heard you had a strange dream last night.

05:44.440 --> 05:46.370
Y-Yes, I did.

06:07.930 --> 06:09.290
There you are.

06:10.100 --> 06:12.400
What's your name?

06:12.400 --> 06:15.170
I'm Toru.

06:15.170 --> 06:18.300
Toru, I see. What a nice name.

06:19.210 --> 06:21.970
We shall meet again. Very soon...

06:28.520 --> 06:30.450
That's how the dream went.

06:34.790 --> 06:37.950
You told her your name?

06:38.190 --> 06:39.250
I wasn't supposed to?!

06:39.960 --> 06:42.560
There's no mistake.
You have been captured by her kotodama.

06:43.300 --> 06:48.460
This puts us at a disadvantage should we
have to fight the yokai from your dream.

06:49.070 --> 06:52.510
Why did you tell her your name?!

06:52.740 --> 06:54.670
Because she asked me.

06:55.240 --> 06:57.300
Do you know what kind the woman was?

06:57.580 --> 06:59.550
Most likely a sort of scaled beast.

07:00.210 --> 07:02.080
Can you fend it off on your own?

07:04.550 --> 07:06.110
We will need some assistance.

07:06.690 --> 07:08.520
It would not hurt, yes.

07:08.990 --> 07:10.860
It was a yokai of the wood affinity, correct?

07:11.130 --> 07:15.120
Yes. The water affinity of the
Mizuchi will only strengthen it.

07:15.500 --> 07:19.260
According to the Five Phases,
only a metal affinity can chop wood.

07:19.570 --> 07:21.260
A yokai of metal...

07:22.200 --> 07:24.730
So we'll need the fox...

07:25.410 --> 07:26.570
Noboru, Toru.

07:26.740 --> 07:27.770
Y-Yes!

07:28.010 --> 07:32.310
You two head to the top of the hill
out back and enter the sealed shrine.

07:33.050 --> 07:36.950
You are to awaken the fox yokai sealed there.

07:38.720 --> 07:43.350
They start talking about yokai and stuff right
when we got here. I can't keep up with them.

07:43.720 --> 07:47.060
Besides, Grandma's more
like a yokai than anything.

07:47.360 --> 07:50.390
You ever saw the pictures of
Mom when she was small?

07:50.830 --> 07:54.100
Grandma looks exactly like
she does now even back then!

07:54.870 --> 07:56.200
That's kind of amazing!

07:57.910 --> 07:59.510
Noboru, Toru.

07:59.510 --> 08:00.630
Y-Yes?!

08:00.980 --> 08:03.210
That is the shrine where...

08:03.210 --> 08:06.110
...the tenko Kugen has been
sealed for hundreds of years.

08:18.890 --> 08:23.020
This shrine can only be opened
by the head of the Mizuchi family.

08:26.730 --> 08:27.530
Here.

08:28.640 --> 08:29.570
What's this?

08:29.570 --> 08:32.370
It's like an incantation to unlock the shrine.

08:32.470 --> 08:38.250
Ever since this shrine was built, that has been
passed down only to the Mizuchi family head.

08:38.250 --> 08:41.040
And only the family head is allowed to read it.

08:41.420 --> 08:42.450
Oh.

08:42.450 --> 08:43.580
Read it.

08:43.720 --> 08:44.650
Who is?

08:44.820 --> 08:46.620
You. Who else?

08:46.620 --> 08:47.820
M-Me?!

08:48.220 --> 08:51.620
Though you haven't had a
formal succession ceremony...

08:51.730 --> 08:55.920
...you are the current head of
the Mizuchi family, Noboru.

08:57.730 --> 08:59.930
When did you become the head?!

08:59.930 --> 09:01.300
I don't know!

09:01.300 --> 09:03.240
I thought men couldn't be the head!

09:03.370 --> 09:05.570
Men just can't be the priestess!

09:05.740 --> 09:07.710
Oh, right...

09:08.080 --> 09:09.910
Now hurry up and read it!

09:11.710 --> 09:12.800
Uhh, let's see...

09:13.280 --> 09:17.080
The celestial maidens descend...

09:17.080 --> 09:23.110
The revered heavenly fox of
ancient times lies enshrined here...

09:23.460 --> 09:24.590
Uhh...

09:24.590 --> 09:27.960
The fox may bring prosperity and disaster alike...

09:28.330 --> 09:35.130
...brought unto those of lowly
birth by the act of knowing them.

10:31.590 --> 10:33.460
It has been a long time...

10:34.130 --> 10:35.720
Tenko-sama...

10:55.820 --> 10:58.180
You're still alive, you monster hag?

10:58.390 --> 11:00.220
It is good to see you as well.

11:00.220 --> 11:04.280
You're more of a monstrosity than even me.

11:04.860 --> 11:07.190
- It's a talking f-f-fox!

11:07.190 --> 11:07.920
- Wow...
- It's a talking f-f-fox!

11:10.830 --> 11:12.770
I see the circumstances are special.

11:15.040 --> 11:17.770
We wish to ask for your assistance.

11:17.840 --> 11:21.210
A member of the Mizuchi is
being targeted by a yokai.

11:21.440 --> 11:26.900
Why do you need my help? What about
the all-powerful Mamorime of the Mizuchi?

11:27.420 --> 11:32.350
Neither the Mizuchi nor the Mamorime
are as powerful as in the olden days.

11:34.990 --> 11:38.860
I see the glory of you water
shamans has all but vanished.

11:38.860 --> 11:42.300
So you've come to beg for my help.

11:42.430 --> 11:44.560
Seems quite convenient, don't you think?

11:44.670 --> 11:50.040
You first enshrined me as the guardian deity
of Mizuchi and then proceeded to seal me.

11:50.100 --> 11:52.070
You are not completely without fault.

11:52.970 --> 11:59.110
You summoned flames and paraded monsters,
even under the light of day...

11:59.610 --> 12:01.780
You made livestock speak the words of man!

12:01.780 --> 12:03.980
You caused the abnormal increase in pests!

12:03.980 --> 12:06.150
You brought a giant squid to the nearby seas!

12:07.020 --> 12:10.960
Either way, I have no intention of
aiding a member of the Mizuchi.

12:11.290 --> 12:13.620
Go on and get eaten by that yokai!

12:17.470 --> 12:22.600
I wonder if you can still say that after
finding out who is the one being targeted.

12:23.140 --> 12:24.870
Oh? So who is it?

12:25.140 --> 12:27.160
Miyako's son.

12:29.310 --> 12:31.240
Allow me to introduce you...

12:31.550 --> 12:36.180
This is the head of the Mizuchi family,
Noboru, and his brother, Toru.

12:36.620 --> 12:38.810
Which one is being targeted?

12:39.090 --> 12:41.050
That would be the younger one.

12:41.290 --> 12:43.760
Being of a bloodline of the darker yin variety...

12:43.820 --> 12:48.630
It appears that the powers are more
predominant in the one closer to that property.

12:49.360 --> 12:51.630
Your name is Kugen?

12:52.070 --> 12:54.400
Correct. I am Kugen.

12:56.870 --> 12:58.840
So I can call you Ku-chan.

13:03.480 --> 13:07.500
You truly are Miyako's son, I see.

13:07.650 --> 13:09.650
How old are you two?

13:09.650 --> 13:11.450
S-Sixteen.

13:11.450 --> 13:12.690
Eleven.

13:12.690 --> 13:14.280
How is Miyako?

13:19.630 --> 13:21.650
Miyako has already passed away...

13:22.700 --> 13:25.220
You humans are too fragile.

13:25.970 --> 13:28.030
Was Miyako a good mother?

13:35.210 --> 13:38.980
I see... I see...

13:41.220 --> 13:43.120
Very well, Hashirame.

13:47.520 --> 13:51.290
I don't like this one bit,
but I will play along for now.

13:51.490 --> 13:57.760
But make no mistake. I am doing this for
Miyako's son, not the Mizuchi bloodline.

14:09.810 --> 14:11.180
I see you're all here.

14:15.180 --> 14:15.980
Who're you?

14:16.420 --> 14:17.440
You can't tell?

14:23.090 --> 14:24.890
Whoops.

14:27.130 --> 14:30.390
It's been a while since I transformed,
so I haven't gotten my bearings yet.

14:31.070 --> 14:31.760
Ku-chan?

14:31.970 --> 14:32.830
That's right!

14:35.900 --> 14:37.930
You're female?!

14:38.840 --> 14:45.350
You forget which one you were born
as if you've lived as long as I have.

14:45.350 --> 14:48.180
Though it doesn't really matter now.

14:48.350 --> 14:52.090
If you don't like this form, I can become male.

14:52.090 --> 14:53.250
Which do you prefer?

14:53.550 --> 14:55.020
Are you ready?

14:55.520 --> 14:56.320
Toru-sama.

14:57.490 --> 15:01.690
The yokai about to come already
has power over your name.

15:02.230 --> 15:05.030
Even if your name is called, do not respond.

15:05.270 --> 15:06.460
O-Okay...

15:09.900 --> 15:11.900
I have created a barrier around this room.

15:13.340 --> 15:15.640
Though I don't know how effective it will be...

15:43.740 --> 15:44.600
She's here.

15:48.140 --> 15:49.040
Strange.

15:49.680 --> 15:50.670
It will not open.

15:56.920 --> 16:01.120
I see. So a seal has been placed here.

16:05.030 --> 16:08.790
She knows! Be careful! She will definitely
use the kotodama of your name!

16:09.060 --> 16:09.790
Okay.

16:10.600 --> 16:12.960
Hey, Toru. You scared?

16:13.330 --> 16:14.130
Yeah...

16:14.230 --> 16:17.690
I-It's okay! We're all here for you!

16:18.010 --> 16:18.770
Yeah...

16:18.770 --> 16:20.900
Hey! You okay?

16:21.010 --> 16:21.630
Yeah...

16:22.240 --> 16:23.340
Toru...

16:23.340 --> 16:24.110
Yeah?

16:26.550 --> 16:27.280
The barrier...

16:30.250 --> 16:32.780
You idiot! They just told you not to respond!

16:32.990 --> 16:34.850
Huh? Oh, right...

16:37.260 --> 16:40.690
I guess you're the kind that
doesn't follow warnings!

16:55.780 --> 16:57.330
It opened. It finally opened...

16:57.510 --> 16:59.640
My sweet Toru...

17:02.520 --> 17:05.490
Toru... Come to me...

17:05.490 --> 17:07.350
He's not gonna go just because you said...

17:07.350 --> 17:08.750
Hey! No way!

17:08.960 --> 17:09.580
Toru!

17:09.720 --> 17:11.780
Noboru! Stay on the platform!

17:11.930 --> 17:13.520
B-But!

17:16.860 --> 17:17.920
Toru, don't go.

17:20.570 --> 17:23.040
My connection with this land runs deep.

17:23.040 --> 17:28.940
I don't need to control his name to have
a greater influence with the kotodama.

17:29.380 --> 17:31.140
How dare you interfere!

17:33.410 --> 17:36.510
The blood of the Mizuchi is really rich.

17:36.650 --> 17:39.120
You'll get the runs if you
eat stuff you're not used to!

17:39.620 --> 17:40.810
That is none your concern!

17:41.190 --> 17:45.420
Why must you aid the humans?!
Do they have control over your name?!

17:47.130 --> 17:51.190
A fox... I see. Now I remember.

17:51.500 --> 17:55.370
There was some old fox worshiped and
enshrined as a god because it controlled water.

17:55.640 --> 18:00.470
But the fox's petty tricks were too
much and it was sealed as punishment.

18:00.940 --> 18:03.500
You don't mean to say you are that fox?

18:04.480 --> 18:06.410
So it is you.

18:06.650 --> 18:11.310
What a fool. You aid the very
people who sealed you away!

18:11.390 --> 18:13.750
Watch your mouth, you punk!

18:20.130 --> 18:21.650
It uses lightning!

18:24.570 --> 18:28.570
You're the Mamorime of Mizuchi, so
you can manipulate water, right?

18:28.570 --> 18:29.440
Yes.

18:29.440 --> 18:31.560
On my cue, use Glow.

18:31.810 --> 18:36.610
But we are facing a wood yokai.
A water spell will be ineffective.

18:36.610 --> 18:38.640
Just do as I say!

18:54.930 --> 18:58.330
Metal chops wood...
The property of metal overpowers wood!

18:58.570 --> 19:03.000
That may be true. However, your
sword is not enough to kill me!

19:06.410 --> 19:08.340
You won't deflect this one!

19:14.750 --> 19:15.620
Oh, no!

19:15.620 --> 19:18.240
She's going to lose! We have to run!

19:18.920 --> 19:19.540
Mamorime!

19:37.470 --> 19:41.130
Did her own lightning cause her to
electrocute herself through the water?

19:42.380 --> 19:44.740
It seems your wits are still about you...

19:46.980 --> 19:50.140
Did she win?! Are we okay now?
Can we move now?!

19:51.590 --> 19:54.350
Hey, take a look at this!

19:57.020 --> 19:58.120
A snake...

19:58.460 --> 20:01.300
Now let's see what I should do with you.

20:01.300 --> 20:02.560
Please have mercy!

20:02.730 --> 20:04.530
Toru! You decide!

20:05.600 --> 20:09.070
Decide if you want to spare this
snake or dispose of it right now.

20:09.070 --> 20:11.370
Dispose of it? You mean kill it?

20:11.570 --> 20:14.910
If you let it go, there's no guarantee
it won't attack you again!

20:23.780 --> 20:25.340
It's okay. Let it go.

20:26.390 --> 20:27.940
I knew you'd say that.

20:28.460 --> 20:29.820
Tenko-sama!

20:30.190 --> 20:34.130
If you want to release it, at least bind
it with the kotodama of its name first!

20:34.130 --> 20:36.690
I really don't care to know its real name...

20:37.830 --> 20:39.990
But I guess it'll be easier that way.

20:40.430 --> 20:43.270
Hey, snake. What's your name?

20:43.500 --> 20:45.710
My name is Kotojinonushi.

20:45.710 --> 20:51.840
If you ever show your dirty face here again, I'll
eat you no matter what Toru says! Understand?!

20:53.750 --> 20:54.680
Thank you...

20:56.850 --> 21:00.120
What do you intend to do with the tenko after this?

21:00.420 --> 21:03.580
It goes without saying.
I will have it return to the shrine.

21:04.730 --> 21:08.000
That's not fair! She saved us!

21:08.000 --> 21:08.860
This cannot be changed.

21:10.460 --> 21:11.230
Yes it can!

21:11.930 --> 21:17.870
The sealed shrine can only be opened
and closed by the head of the family!

21:17.870 --> 21:19.110
Tatsuhiko!

21:19.110 --> 21:24.010
It's completely up to Noboru whether or
not we seal the tenko back in the shrine.

21:31.080 --> 21:32.070
I...

21:33.950 --> 21:35.220
...will not seal you!

21:35.460 --> 21:36.320
I can't!

21:39.260 --> 21:43.660
But then I will have to relinquish my
position as guardian deity of the Mizuchi.

21:44.830 --> 21:47.630
I won't be able to stay in this land anymore.

21:48.000 --> 21:49.070
Really?

21:49.070 --> 21:51.230
But that might be better for me!

21:52.940 --> 21:54.000
Hey!

21:54.740 --> 21:56.410
I just thought of a great idea!

21:56.410 --> 21:59.070
Why don't you make me your guardian deity?!

22:01.350 --> 22:03.210
That's a great idea!

22:03.380 --> 22:07.440
It seems Toru is the kind who
attracts yokai, so it'll be perfect!

22:07.950 --> 22:11.980
Yeah. You're the ones who made me jobless!

22:12.560 --> 22:15.320
Besides, I like you two.

22:16.300 --> 22:17.850
How do you feel about me?

22:19.670 --> 22:20.830
I like you!

22:20.830 --> 22:21.800
I like you, too.

22:22.300 --> 22:23.000
Good!

22:25.410 --> 22:27.700
I will now tell you my true name!

22:27.770 --> 22:31.640
It's really important, so I hope you'll treat it in kind.

22:35.450 --> 22:40.120
Ko. Stay with the Takagami
brothers and serve them.

22:40.120 --> 22:44.160
Though their surname may be different,
they are still the heads of the Mizuchi family.

22:44.160 --> 22:44.710
Yes.

22:45.160 --> 22:49.200
Assist the tenko Kugen and
watch over it at the same time.

22:49.200 --> 22:52.200
We still do not know if that whimsical fox...

22:52.200 --> 22:53.370
...will actually protect those two.

22:53.370 --> 22:54.860
Understood.

23:05.310 --> 23:11.770
Sora no hate ga tsunagaru basho wo
Where the horizon meets the earth,

23:12.250 --> 23:19.490
no ni saku hana wa mada kitto shiranai
The flower growing in the wild remains unaware.

23:20.830 --> 23:27.320
Kokoyori ii sekai ga aruto
While thinking that there
is a world better than this.

23:27.470 --> 23:35.100
Kokoro wa itsumo hane wo hirogetagaru
They always desire to spread
the wings of their hearts.

23:36.010 --> 23:43.040
Yume dakede owarasenai
Don't let it end as just a dream,

23:43.650 --> 23:50.150
chansu ga aru hazusa
There's always a chance.

23:50.360 --> 23:57.800
Daijoubu bokura wa hitori janai
It's all right. We are not alone.

23:57.800 --> 24:05.410
Kaze ga nanika wo iouto shiteru
The winds are telling us something.

24:05.410 --> 24:13.080
Daijoubu kanarazu umaku yareru
It's all right. You can do it.

24:13.080 --> 24:24.320
Omoi wa itsuka jibun wo kaeru michi ni naru
Those dreams are a path you'll change yourself.

24:32.070 --> 24:34.470
These station lunchboxes are great!

24:39.670 --> 24:42.070
Ko-chan, why are you up there?

24:42.310 --> 24:45.870
Because I am merely the Mamorime,
it is best I keep myself from view.

24:46.080 --> 24:47.980
Ko-chan...

24:47.980 --> 24:49.850
Noboru, gimme your lunchbox!

